# Precedence under a selection: which token supplies each key of a component.
# The background has two candidates with one part each. The later axis wins, and the state axes come after the
# variant, so the hover background applies, whatever the order of the keys in the document.
> applies button variant=primary state=hover
backgroundColor  button.hover.backgroundColor
color            button.primary.color
paddingBlock     button.paddingBlock
borderRadius     button.borderRadius
font             button.font
— applies

# With nothing selected, the component's own tokens. A token in a plain subgroup (the icon's colour) is not a key.
> applies button
backgroundColor  button.backgroundColor
color            button.color
paddingBlock     button.paddingBlock
borderRadius     button.borderRadius
font             button.font
— applies
